  "observed_contracts": [
    "Calendar correction keeps the original captured job, due time, arrival deadline and final cutoff values. The stale activation receipt still cannot suspend the calendar; a fresh inspection selects its exact live revision.",
    "Suspending that original calendar blocks new routing approval, admission and already queued effects at zero attempts. A pending nonexecuting proposal can still be withdrawn.",
    "After credential rotation, the old credential cannot read routing metadata. The same actor's new credential can inspect historical target metadata and recover the original approval receipt, but cannot restore its old authority or start old queued effects.",
    "The stock intake extension explicitly collects two new batches, runs deterministic CSV checks and separate release, approves corrected recipient rules after capture and queues one exact file with current independent dispatch consent.",
    "Revoking intake leaves historical released-check state intact but current=false, refuses ordinary file and delivery-metadata access, prevents a waiting input from being admitted and refuses the queued work at zero attempts.",
    "Exact scoped read-only database inspection retains one approved dispatch review and zero attempts; run/intent/attempt totals, stock receiver files/hashes and peer contact counts remain unchanged after revocation. No model or scanner participates."
  ],
